        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add gpt-5-high agent suite and refactor planner factory",
        "summary": "Introduced new `gpt-5-high` agent definitions (`base2`, `planner`, `editor`, `reviewer`, `thinker`) using `openai/gpt-5` with high reasoning effort. Refactored the base2 planner into a reusable `plannerFactory` to support multiple model configurations while preserving existing `planner` behavior. Updated `spawn-agents.ts` to stream client output for `editor-gpt-5-high` alongside the standard editor.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T10:34:46.465Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "A new, more advanced version of the coding helper (GPT-5 with high reasoning effort) is now available for tasks like planning, editing, reviewing, and deep thinking. The underlying planner tool was reorganized so the same structure can support different AI models, while the existing planner still works as before. If you look at the agent settings, you'll see new entries for these GPT-5 variants, and the editor will now show output from the new GPT-5 helper alongside the standard one.",
