        "v": 5,
        "title": "Fix gpt-5-high planner spawn logic",
        "summary": "Refactor `plannerFactory` to hardcode `gemini-thinker-high` spawnable agent, removing dynamic `thinkerAgent` param. `planner-gpt-5-high.ts` implements custom `handleSteps` generator, explicitly spawning `file-explorer`, reading paths, then delegating to `gemini-thinker-high`. `planner.ts` updated to match new factory signature. Internal `.agents/base2` subsystem only.",
