      "eli5": {
        "text": "The GPT-5 high planner now spawns a specific thinker agent directly instead of choosing one dynamically, which means its planning flow is fixed and won't change based on different inputs. If you inspected the planner's configuration, you'd see it always calls on the gemini-thinker-high agent and follows a custom step sequence that reads file paths before generating a plan. This only affects the new GPT-5 high planning suite that's being assembled internally.",
